pi-coding-agent (0.84.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.84.3.

  * manpage: document the new "--" end-of-options delimiter.

  * rules: skip coding-agent's esbuild bundle step (build:unbundled
    instead of build); the bundler rejects node:sqlite (from undici 8.x
    SqliteCacheStore) as an unexpected external import on Node 20, where
    isBuiltin("node:sqlite") is false. The bundle only feeds the npm
    bin; the Debian launcher runs dist/cli.js directly.

  * rules: patch coding-agent's fs.globSync (Node 22+) usage with a
    readdirSync + minimatch polyfill for Node 20 compatibility
    (debian/patches/node20-glob-sync.patch).

 -- Thomas Lamprecht <thomas@lamprecht.org>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 11:59:30 +0200

