pi-coding-agent (0.81.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 0.81.1.

  * pi-ai: ship a committed snapshot of the generated model data
    (src/providers/data/*.json). Upstream split the model catalog into
    JSON files under src/providers/data/ that are generated at build time
    from live catalogs and are gitignored. Without them the compiled
    providers import missing JSON and the package crashes at runtime. The
    snapshot is compiled with tsgo and copied into dist verbatim, matching
    upstream's build:offline, keeping the build offline and reproducible
    on Node.js 20.

  * launcher: report the actual Node.js runtime floor (>= 20.18.1) in the
    missing-runtime error message instead of upstream's >= 22.19.0.

 -- Thomas Lamprecht <thomas@lamprecht.org>  Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:10:00 +0200

